cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite this repository and the original GPS-SLAM paper."
title: "EGAS-SLAM: Loop-Closed Gaussian–SDF Submaps for Embedded RGB-D SLAM"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
abstract: "EGAS-SLAM extends GPS-SLAM with coupled local SDF/Gaussian submaps, guarded pose-graph loop correction, tracking containment and native NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor deployment. Developed by Oliver Paver at The University of Manchester under the supervision of Prof. Mikel Luján (ORCID 0000-0002-0842-1083)."
authors:
  - family-names: Paver
    given-names: Oliver
    email: oliver_paver@yahoo.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-5807-6546"
    affiliation: "Department of Computer Science, The University of Manchester"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OliverPaver/gps-slam-submaps-thor"
keywords:
  - SLAM
  - RGB-D
  - 3D Gaussian splatting
  - signed distance field
  - loop closure
  - NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor
references:
